<h1>New Objection</h1>
<p>An objection was submitted for the <strong>{{ month }}</strong> election:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Target: {{ target }}</li>
  <li>Submitted by: {{ objector }}</li>
  <li>Reason: {{ reason }}</li>
</ul>
<p>Review it in the admin panel: <a href="{{ adminUrl }}">{{ adminUrl }}</a></p>
